{-1}\\cdot [T]_{C}\\cdot {P}_{B\\to C}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324193 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 34 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324193 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324193 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1a66c93a-af60-53aa-a747-1ca57d557a70" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324692 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324692 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324692 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5669535f-e936-5808-865c-2ffa3ed1afbc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324843 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324843 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324843 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "686be3d1-f70d-534b-8c1d-122b77f7f1cb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325181 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}23 & -26 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325181 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325181 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8e7b1556-61ad-5b7b-b55a-24309469ebf0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325293 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325293 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325293 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9c139bdc-ae5e-5940-826c-9936fe328b58" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325542 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -26 \\\\ -1 & -5\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325542 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325542 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b6c4df6c-f5d6-5a2a-93b7-7a763a5ccac4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325552 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 16 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325552 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 1759218